  "translation": "Gideɔn ye kuma Elohim fɛ: kana i dusi ɲɛgɛn ne kan, k'a sɔrɔ ne bɛna kuma dɔrɔn o sugandi la; aw, seɛnɛnɛ ne dɔrɔn o sugandi la sɔgɔgizu fɛ — aw, kɛnɛ kɛ sɔgɔgizu in kan dɔrɔn, ani dugukolo bɛɛ kan, sɔgɔma-ji ka kɛ yen.",
